# The domain Caddy serves HTTPS for, taken from SITE_DOMAIN in .env.
# For a dry run set SITE_DOMAIN=standby.inferthmapping.co.zw and point that
# record at this VPS. During a real outage SITE_DOMAIN stays as the live
# domain and the DNS flip at the registrar makes issuance succeed.
#
# First visit after a flip triggers certificate issuance (a few seconds).

{$SITE_DOMAIN:www.inferthmapping.co.zw} {
	reverse_proxy app:8000
}
